%% Phase 2 — Polling 튜닝 (1K ~ 5K TPS)
flowchart LR
    Client[클라이언트]:::client
    API[Transfer-API<br/>@Transactional]:::svc
    PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>HikariCP 20)]:::store
    R0[Relay 0]:::relay
    R1[Relay 1]:::relay
    R2[Relay 2]:::relay
    R3[Relay 3]:::relay
    R4[Relay 4]:::relay
    K{{Kafka<br/>batch.size=64KB<br/>linger.ms=20}}:::queue
